  "notes": "The current bridge completed an exactly-once follow-up on the bound ChatGPT conversation and a detached watcher finalized the response after ten exact-URL observations. Boss selected the pure-script RootWait continuation because the current Desktop build does not dispatch Stop. Fresh root sends may now persist acknowledged sent state while the exact URL is pending. A 2026-08-06 live attempt proved that send and RootWait launch path, then exposed a detached worker exit with no event. wait-root now detects the dead worker, writes a no-resend worker-crashed terminal event, and preserves hidden-worker stdout/stderr for diagnosis; the real stale evidence returned and was acknowledged. Parser 5/5 and full Skill Pester 204/204 pass. A complete fresh live RootWait completed E2E and removal of the thinking-duration status line from extracted response evidence remain unproved.",
